\title{Kruskal on graphs with repeated weights}
\date{2026-10-09T16:51:08Z}
\tag{algorithms}
\taxon{Remark}

\import{algorithms-macros}

\p{The [previous theorem](00OM) applies only to graphs where every edge has a distinct weight, but it is [not too much harder to show that Kruskal's Algorithm works even when there are repeated weights](00OO).}
